<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>You’re Invited: Faculty and Staff Holiday Party</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Friday, December 11, 4–6 p.m. in the Kate Buchanan Room</mj-preview>
    <mj-font
      name="Roboto Condensed"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap"
    />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section padding="0" />
      <mj-column padding="0" />
      <mj-image padding="0" />
      <mj-text
        color="#173b30"
        font-size="14px"
        line-height="20px"
        padding="0"
      />
      <mj-divider border-width="1px" padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style inline="inline">
      .artwork-column,
      .content-column {
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .artwork-column {
        background-color: #173b30;
        background-image: url('https://mailings.humboldt.edu/president/2026_holiday_invite/pattern.png');
        background-repeat: repeat;
      }

      .content-column {
        background-color: #f8e8d6;
      }
    </mj-style>
    <mj-style>
      @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .artwork-column {
          display: none !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          max-width: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          width: 0 !important;
        }

        .content-column {
          max-width: 100% !important;
          width: 100% !important;
        }

        .intro-label,
        .intro-heading,
        .event-details,
        .body-copy,
        .support-heading,
        .support-copy {
          padding-left: 28px !important;
          padding-right: 28px !important;
        }

        .intro-label {
          padding-top: 36px !important;
        }

        .title-lockup {
          padding-left: 28px !important;
          padding-right: 28px !important;
        }

        .event-details div {
          font-size: 25px !important;
          line-height: 32px !important;
        }

        .body-copy div,
        .support-copy div {
          font-size: 17px !important;
          line-height: 24px !important;
        }

        .support-heading div {
          font-size: 18px !important;
          line-height: 24px !important;
        }

        .section-rule {
          padding-left: 28px !important;
          padding-right: 28px !important;
        }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body width="600px" background-color="#173b30">
    <mj-section background-color="#173b30">
      <mj-column width="22.25%" css-class="artwork-column">
        <mj-image
          src="https://mailings.humboldt.edu/president/2026_holiday_invite/decor-left.png"
          alt=""
          width="134px"
        />
      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="59.08%" css-class="content-column">
        <mj-text
          css-class="intro-label"
          font-size="13px"
          letter-spacing="2px"
          line-height="18px"
          padding="66px 32px 0 40px"
        >
          You’re Invited!
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          css-class="intro-heading"
          font-size="25px"
          line-height="32px"
          padding="5px 32px 0 40px"
        >
          Faculty and Staff
        </mj-text>

        <mj-image
          css-class="title-lockup"
          src="https://mailings.humboldt.edu/president/2026_holiday_invite/holiday-party.png"
          alt="Holiday Party"
          align="left"
          width="250px"
          padding="28px 32px 0 40px"
        />

        <mj-divider
          border-color="#173b30"
          border-width="5px"
          width="48px"
          align="left"
          padding="18px 0 0 40px"
        />

        <mj-text
          css-class="event-details"
          color="#567649"
          font-size="24px"
          font-weight="700"
          letter-spacing="1px"
          line-height="32px"
          padding="20px 32px 0 40px"
        >
          Friday, December 11<br />
          4–6 p.m.<br />
          Kate Buchanan Room
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          css-class="body-copy"
          padding="16px 32px 0 40px"
        >
          Join us for an evening of celebration, connection, and holiday cheer.
          Food, drinks, and festive spirit await!
        </mj-text>

        <mj-divider
          css-class="section-rule"
          border-color="#769486"
          padding="27px 32px 0 40px"
        />

        <mj-text
          css-class="support-heading"
          font-size="17px"
          font-weight="700"
          line-height="24px"
          padding="25px 32px 0 40px"
        >
          Support Oh SNAP!
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          css-class="support-copy"
          padding="13px 32px 0 40px"
        >
          We’ll have a donation table for non-perishable, non-expired pantry
          items and basic hygiene supplies. Your contributions will support Oh
          SNAP!, our campus student-run food pantry, and help fuel students and
          set them up for success.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          css-class="support-copy"
          padding="13px 32px 34px 40px"
        >
          As we enter the season of giving, let’s continue supporting our
          wonderful students and one another. It takes a village, and we can
          accomplish greater things when we help each other out.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="18.67%" css-class="artwork-column">
        <mj-image
          src="https://mailings.humboldt.edu/president/2026_holiday_invite/decor-right.png"
          alt=""
          width="112px"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#173b30">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="https://mailings.humboldt.edu/president/2026_holiday_invite/decor-footer.png"
          alt=""
          width="600px"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
